<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Fotografia estenopeica on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/category/fotografia-estenopeica/</link><description>Recent content in Fotografia estenopeica on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ca</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/category/fotografia-estenopeica/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>27-04-2025 – Dia mundial de la fotografia estenopeica 2025</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/04/15/27-04-2025-dia-mundial-de-la-fotografia-estenopeica-2025/</link><pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/04/15/27-04-2025-dia-mundial-de-la-fotografia-estenopeica-2025/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/linuxbcn-org/2025/04/cartell-pinhole-day-2025_3-724x1024-1.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data i lloc&lt;/strong&gt;: Diumenge, 27 d’abril de 2025 – 11h&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ubicació&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/sala_basiana.espai_sagrerina/"&gt;Sala Basiana&lt;/a&gt;
 (dins la &lt;a href="https://naubostik.com"&gt;Nau Bostik&lt;/a&gt;
)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enguany tornem a celebrar el &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://pinholeday.org/index.php?setlang=en"&gt;Dia Internacional de la Fotografia Estenopeica&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/strong&gt;! Novament, la &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/sala_basiana.espai_sagrerina/"&gt;Sala Basiana&lt;/a&gt;
 —dins la &lt;a href="https://naubostik.com"&gt;Nau Bostik&lt;/a&gt;
— serà el punt de trobada on podrem gaudir d’un dia primaveral i fer un got per no deshidratar-nos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pel que fa a les activitats, encara que estem en precari, la idea és passar-ho bé i fer una o diverses fotografies amb aquesta tècnica fotogràfica primitiva i crua.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-04-30- Wordwide Photograny Pinhole Day 2023</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/04/30/2023-04-30-wordwide-photograny-pinhole-day-2023/</link><pubDate>Sun, 30 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/04/30/2023-04-30-wordwide-photograny-pinhole-day-2023/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/BxVQZxW3y3Q8VaKF8" aria-label="Veure l'àlbum complet"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AJFCJaXmL8BiNVvBwDHu8jV4_8YCm3OMVoclv2WjROSOD5F-Syt5y7NWFhGphYMoCYv9keWOufMYNS3jd6Dny08_yG_0jOFgimwt4gSMCcnzdlkcR-W7MJRRNGl3Kj5FtXT2t8H-RhkpJKBoYNPg5NoNrDeurA=w1879-h1130-s-no?authuser=0" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un any més s&amp;rsquo;ha celebrat el dia internacional de la fotografia estenopeica. Així que uns quants freakies hem ajuntat forces i hem fet les nostres fotografies. Aquí alguns dels resultats. Encara queda material per escanejar.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Amb tres estenops per Subirats</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2021/12/28/amb-tres-estenops-per-subirats/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Dec 2021 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2021/12/28/amb-tres-estenops-per-subirats/</guid><description>&lt;figure&gt;
